(text "U1 node order VIN FB OUT GND ON_OFF_N = physical pins 1 4 2 3 5. FB directly senses VOUT.\nR1 = inductor DCR; R4 = input ESR; R2 = lumped output series resistance. Intended hardware adds 56mOhm.\nStress ESR cases may violate that hardware bound. V3 commands a load, reduced below 4.75V." (at 20 244 0) (effects (font (size 1.0 1.0)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid ffab7174-e99a-5dc2-9bbd-a22b16a04097))
